WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
The precious arms

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
This love...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
Omoi wo

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.280
No, it's too dangerous.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.490
You'll risk being found.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:41.870
My aunt's stew...

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:46.370
it's dinnertime. it's getting late, so stay and eat.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.460
Wait, Kurau...

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.710
Your father...

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.010
What kind of a man was he?

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.970
You can tell me next time, okay?

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:11.980
Are you done talking?

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.230
Yes, we're done.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:17.150
Okay!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.030
Then it's dinnertime!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.820
I should...

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.950
Ayaka's going to join us.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.580
Yeah, help us cook!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.510
Can you make a salad?

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:37.470
Yes...

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.340
Then it's all yours.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:41.800
Here.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.700
Each Path

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.090
it's delicious!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.760
Yes, very!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.180
What's wrong?

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.140
Make sure you eat a lot.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.860
It looks... too good to eat...

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.530
Don't worry. We have lots more!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.610
Okay... Thank you for the food.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:47.620
Oh yes! I heard that Clara next door
came home from the city.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.790
Is that right? That girl's back?
It's been a while, hasn't it?

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:54.580
Dear, I was talking about the watchdog, Clara.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.500
Huh?! Oh, I see!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:09.640
Those twins... I want to find them.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.020
Before the GPO gets to them.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:16.150
I don't want what happened to Yvon to ever happen again...

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.360
Maybe all they want is to live a peaceful life too.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.530
Just like us now...

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.540
I understand your decision.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.170
It's probably something that only you can do, Kurau.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:45.510
Go on ahead.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:49.470
But Kurau, you must make sure to
protect yourself first.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.220
Please be very careful.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:54.190
I will... Uncle... Aunt...

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.650
Kurau, I'll go with you!

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.690
Okay, let's go together.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:01.690
Okay!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.460
Ryna sapiens...

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:23.420
All this time I was capturing them,
thinking they were dangerous beings...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.930
Without even trying to see what they're really like.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:34.480
By capturing them, I felt that my anxiety would
disappear, and my darkness would be lifted.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:40.150
I never even thought of how they were
treated after being captured...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.610
Could it have been anybody?

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:49.570
As long as I could get rid of my anxiety,
did it matter who the enemy was?

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.120
When did I become like this?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.000
Can't sleep?

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.300
I hope I didn't force you to stay.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:08.510
Oh no, I had a good time and it made me happy.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:12.260
And... dinner was delicious.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.310
Kurau...

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:21.020
Aren't you scared of me?
I've been chasing you all this time.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.400
Well... you always seemed so lonely...

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:53.600
Here...

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.930
I should return this to you...

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.570
I envy you.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.040
I lost something I should've protected.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:19.910
They were taken away from me.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.290
Ayaka...

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.920
I'm thinking about seeing him...

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.180
That man...

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.180
That man killed my family...

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.930
If that's really true, then I...

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:45.310
I need to find out... what he's trying to do...

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.150
All of it...

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.370
I got through.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.000
Call me when you get information.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.260
And of course, even if you don't have anything...

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.670
Kurau...

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.170
Kurau! Is that really you, Kurau?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:54.630
What happened?

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.100
Oh, nothing...

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.100
Dad!

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.430
I'm with Ted.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.140
Am I intruding?

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.600
No, not at all.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:11.150
I'm so glad... Really glad... That you're okay...

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.780
I'm sorry.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:17.820
I wanted to call you sooner, but I didn't how to reach you.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.120
Jeez, you sure made me worry.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.660
How's Christmas?

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.370
I'm fine, Doug!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.000
Hurry up.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.370
Let's get together soon, okay?

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.830
Sure.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.210
I'm going on a trip tomorrow, but when I get back...

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:34.720
A trip? Be careful of the GPO...

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.260
I'll be fine. Don't worry.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.010
Oh yeah, if we're going to get together, I'll invite her too.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.180
Her?

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.350
Ayaka Steiger of the GPO.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.390
We've become friends.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:50.690
What on Earth is going on? I tell you!

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.190
Marseilles?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.530
Yes. I got a call from Ayaka.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:10:01.660
She said the twins powers were detected in Marseilles, France.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.200
Can they find you if you use your powers?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:11.500
No. Apparently, a special device has been implanted into the twins

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.420
that gives off signals when they use Rynax powers.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.170
That's awful...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:19.180
We have to find those two quickly.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.090
Twins...

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:59.970
Windt... Regel...

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.030
Wow!

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.570
Look at all the seagulls!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:47.510
Kurau...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.740
What... is this?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.420
What the heck is this doing here?

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:15.210
I have no idea...

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.630
The car is fused with the road.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.550
The power of a Rynax...

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.350
Do you think those two did this?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:41.690
If they keep this up, the GPO will find them.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.150
It's like they're playing around.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:00.550
Kurau...

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:06.800
Wait!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.470
What is this?

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:11.720
Two guys made this for us a little while ago.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.020
It's weird, isn't it?

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:14.890
Christmas.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:27.780
Any Rynax?

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.030
I don't feel anything.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.160
But they must be here.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.080
Just now...

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.080
Rynax.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.290
Where?

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.250
From over there...

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:49.550
That's...

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:50.930
What's that?

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:03.570
This is terrible... Why would they do such a thing?

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.130
What I felt earlier is gone now...

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.460
This is weird, Kurau...

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:26.010
it's like the two of them are just doing this to amuse themselves.

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.970
Kurau's here.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.350
She's come after us.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.940
But... this is perfect.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.350
Yeah...

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:42.980
If it's Kurau, she may be able to do it...

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.990
We searched for two days.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:58.460
I think it's safe to say they're no longer in this town.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:01.500
All right. I'll check on my end too.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.250
We'll go back to Switzerland for now.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.630
How's it going for you?

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.010
I'm on my way now.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.220
You okay, Ayaka?

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.640
Yes. My mind is set.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.180
I'm glad you made it.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.510
What is this?

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:57.930
I've reserved the whole place. Just for you and me.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:02.190
Have a seat. Let's have a drink.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.650
What's wrong?

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.280
Sorry to call you out. You must be busy.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.530
Not at all.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:20.160
I was just thinking that I'd like to talk to you too.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.080
I see...

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:30.710
Commissioner...

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:38.430
You are using Rynax, no, humans as well,
to make Ryna sapiens into weapons.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:39.720
Is this correct?

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.310
Please answer me, Commissioner.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.650
Fifty years ago, there was a war.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.320
I'm sure you know about it, right?

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.950
Please don't change the subject.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.490
Just listen.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:17:00.410
How do you think the world was able to
find its way out from the deep hatred of War

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.200
and walk down the path of Peace?

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:07.580
It's because of an organization called the GPO.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:16.430
Blue energy... We discovered this cutting-edge
energy and used it to build peace.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:20.680
Using Ryna sapiens as weapons
is simply an extension of that.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.430
That doesn't give you the right to do as you please!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:27.230
We cannot keep peace by simply
placing a high value on life.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:30.820
No... You're wrong.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.860
You are doing something that
should never be done.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.620
How interesting...

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.290
You are so much like your father.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:49.000
He completely disagreed with my idea and
even planned to oust me from the GPO.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.670
But history has proven it.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:58.760
If your father were alive, the world would have gone down the wrong path.

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:14.570
So he got in your way? My father?

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:51.520
I was afraid that I might have had to kill you.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:52.940
But...

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.440
I won't kill you.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:19:00.320
Because if I do, then it'll put me
on the same side as you!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.710
This girl, Kurau, who you talked about...

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.460
I heard she's alive.

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:18.220
I've issued an order to the twin Rynax to capture her.

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.640
If you'll excuse me.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:29.810
Although the twins are nowhere
to be found themselves...

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.440
Ayaka Steiger...

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.570
She knows too much...

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.530
Has her former boss been feeding her information?

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.100
Where are those two?

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:26.870
Rynax!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.870
They're close!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.960
You two...

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.420
Kurau's surprised.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:27.590
Your powers are awesome...

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:29.430
Why are you doing this?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.560
Kurau...

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:33.930
We want to make Rynax pour out of you.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.820
From a great distance

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.820
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:56.160
You smile at me

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:56.160
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:05.300
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:05.300
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:14.390
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:14.390
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:23.610
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:23.610
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:32.740
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:32.740
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:41.880
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:41.880
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:50.970
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:50.970
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.220 --> 00:23:00.190
Moonlight

00:22:53.220 --> 00:23:00.190
Moonlight

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.950
Next Episode

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:11.950
What are you talking about?

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:13.700
You disappoint us, Kurau.

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:17.080
We've been listening to your voice all along.

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:18.460
My voice?

00:23:18.460 --> 00:23:20.670
You're the one who called us.

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:22.670
I never called you...

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.960
Open The Window
